# The pristine stmakd. usr/bin/stmakd, listed above, is only a
# symlink onto /var/lib/stratumak/bin/stmakd, which points here in turn
# until an administrator rebuilds locally. This is the file dpkg owns and
# replaces on upgrade; the /var one is deliberately not packaged at all.
